        question: "Which agencies regulate industrial stormwater in Texas and Louisiana?",
        answer: "The state environmental agency issues the industrial stormwater discharge permit - the Texas Commission on Environmental Quality under TPDES in Texas, the Department of Environmental Quality under LPDES in Louisiana. Local drainage falls to the city, county drainage district, or parish. Federal SPCC rules govern oil spill containment. The engineer coordinates all of them, since each has its own application, design criteria, and timeline.",
